# Kind $9A's bounce (Kind9AWaitWork, $84:A4F7: sound $12, animation
# $18): once burst (K9A_BOUNCES set) Aladdin coming down on it bounces
# off, which no script has him do. Played as cov_kind9a_burst.box (stage
# a5 s2, view x $1200, Aladdin x $1240): after the burst (frame 617) it
# sits at x $1238, y $00AC; Aladdin is put above it (x $1238, y $0070) 8
# times, 25 frames apart, and falls onto it.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s2.state
wait 30
poke 001773 00,12
poke 0019E5 00,12
poke 001777 00,00
poke 0019E9 00,00
poke 0008E7 40,12
poke 0008EA 80,00
wait 580
repeat 8
poke 0008E7 38,12
poke 0008EA 70,00
wait 25
end
wait 200
